From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:40:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AIM #247: plynule otacanie kamery dokola (AUTO_ROTATE)

Sprava mosta AUTO_ROTATE start|stop (rychlost, smer): slucka po snimkoch cez
cameraCallbacks.applyViewpoint otaca pohlad okolo ciela. Zastavi ho stop, tah,
koliesko, dotyk na platne, Esc a kazdy iny pohyb kamery. Cista matematika v
aim/autoRotatePlan.ts s testom, beh v lenivom aim/autoRotate.ts.
